name framebase-schema
# FrameBase's schema: Turtle, a statement on every line. Every statement is recorded as written: its subject, its
# predicate and its object, an identifier without its angle brackets and a text with its quotes off; a text says, as a
# pair, its language tag or its datatype. Statements of blank nodes and collections are not read.
match FrameBase_schema_*.ttl
format turtle
tier statement by \n

thing triple subject
thing rdf_literal value
content *
relate property predicate to object_list
pair rdf_literal lang_tag datatype
